WEBVTT

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.020
He is still alive?!

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.430
Impossible!

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.700
I am darkness.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.840
This is not enough to defeat me!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.570
I am sorry, Kintoki.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.340
It seems I may be unable to fulfill my role of keeping you alive.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.440
Raiko-<i>sama</i> has Seimei now!

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.960
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:08.710
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:14.320
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:19.590
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:24.050
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:31.670
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:36.940
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:42.940
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.950
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.020
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:53.250
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:58.860
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:08.860
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:14.940
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.650
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.880
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.990
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:28.000
"RUDRA"

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.830
Thinking back, we were both just being stubborn this whole time.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:47.070
It seems we were truly cut from the same cloth, Grandfather.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:51.910
Let's go, Raiko.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.580
Please take care of Kiyome.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.050
With my life!

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:04.690
Kaguya, what's wrong?

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:07.320
Talent is not craftiness.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.330
Douman!

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.820
No!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.370
Wait!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.210
I won't let you escape!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.240
We can't just stand here doing nothing!

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.150
But we do not know Douman's whereabouts!

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:32.780
I know!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.520
Calm down, Raiko.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.090
There must be a way.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:38.650
No...

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.520
You mustn't do such a thing!

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:42.340
What's wrong, Kaguya?

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.920
Rudra is being released.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.510
Awaken, Rudra!

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:29.240
I will become one with you and make your power mine!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.000
Then, the capital.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.240
The Light Palace!

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:41.110
No, I will steal away all the light in this world!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:44.850
I will cover it with true darkness!

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.350
Now, the time of incarnation!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.090
We couldn't stop it.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:34.360
A monster!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:41.430
It has finally happened.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.790
That is...

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:04.320
Rudra!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.310
So this is your desire...

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:28.850
However, I will not let you do what you wish with the Light Palace.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.030
We must stop it.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.130
We must stop Rudra!

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.800
Kaguya. You have saved Raiko many times.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.200
And, you also saved me.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.770
From here on out, it's our job.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:43.700
Let's go!

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.670
Wait, what are we going to do against a monster like that?!

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.470
We'll think of something!

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:52.440
Watch over me, Grandfather!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.620
Sorry for making you wait, Rudra.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.690
Now is the time you become my strength!

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.160
A monster!

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.350
I will distract it!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.520
Evacuate the people!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.420
Save as many lives as you possibly can!

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:12.190
Yes!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.920
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:23.240
They plan to shut out the people who desperately wish to be saved?!

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.940
How horrible!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.540
We will take care of this!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.580
Please go to Suzaku Gate, Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.140
But...

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.010
I will return quickly!

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.780
--Let us in!
--Save us!

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.220
Please at least save this child!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.450
You're in the way!
Stand down! Stand down, I say!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:42.960
What are you doing?!
Open the gate and let the people in!

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:48.230
Unfortunately, we cannot allow such lowly people into the Light Palace!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.830
Can you not see that creature?!

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:54.100
The Minister of the Left ordered it to be so.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.760
Move!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.970
Please wait! Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.640
Please!

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:12.950
I beg of you!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:18.160
For just a moment in this state of emergency, for a mere moment!

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.460
Allow the people to take shelter in the Light Palace!

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:23.500
In exchange, I will protect this capital with my life...

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.530
This is the capital.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:32.310
Only the Light Palace is the capital to me.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:36.610
That Horror will not be able to break through the barrier here.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:42.980
Beyond this place are insects trying to nest near the light.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:48.460
Let the Horror eliminate them, it will save me the trouble.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:52.560
Yorinobu, you may stay here if you wish.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:56.330
As long as you are here, you are safe.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.060
He is insane!

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:07.980
Hurry! Everyone, head toward the Light Palace!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.880
But the Suzaku Gate...

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.710
Believe in Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:13.650
He will be sure to...

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.140
Is this the end of the line?

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:38.040
Douman! So, you've been absorbed?!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.410
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:40.770
Yeah.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:46.180
I will cut all the ties of inner darkness

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.010
and push away the shadows!

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.310
So big!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.380
Seimei, that's...

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:58.310
A gift Rudra left behind for me.

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:03.550
It forgot this thing as it was pushed out from inside of me.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.610
Not fair!

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.900
Kintoki!

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:37.450
Kintoki, are you all right?

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.420
This is nothing!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.990
Mother!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:10.980
A ground battle is disadvantageous against that huge thing. Use her!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.530
Kintoki, I'll search for a blind side! Circle around!

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:21.360
Understood!

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:26.500
Twelve faces in total.
Looks like we won't find a blind spot.

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.970
Agreed, Raiko-<i>sama...</i>

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:33.410
What?

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:36.340
No, it's nothing.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:40.250
How long has it been,

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:45.590
since the last time Raiko-<i>sama</i> and I fought with Seimei by our side?

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.190
Hm?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:50.260
We'll just have to destroy them one by one. Kintoki!

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.690
Yes!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:02.760
This is ultimate happiness for me!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.440
One down!

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:14.610
Let us in!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:20.020
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, it is dangerous outside!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.180
You should not go out.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.290
Open the gates!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:31.770
Let the people in! Let them take refuge within the Light Palace!

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:36.600
This is a direct order from the generous Minister of the Left,

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.610
Fujiwarano Michinaga-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.700
Move quickly!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.750
Impossible...

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:11.840
There is nothing I cannot do.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.440
I will quickly get it back.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.410
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>! Michinaga-<i>sama</i>!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:22.110
The filthy ones have gotten as far as the Pine Grove of Banquets!

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:24.850
Yorinobu...

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.320
Cut him down.

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:28.120
Cut that man down.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.620
Yes!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.990
My...

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:34.030
My Light Palace has been tainted?!

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:37.660
The filthy commoners, who are worse than any Horror!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.200
People of the capital!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.700
Thank you for coming.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:47.780
The monsters of the land cannot enter this place.

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:53.950
I have allowed you all entrance for this one night. Be at ease.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.280
And, behold!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.720
That is my confidant, the Golden Knight.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:03.690
He will be sure to eliminate that monster!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:07.190
There is nothing to worry about.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:17.040
Your way of life, now and forever, will be eternally secure!

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.740
Unbelievable.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:23.340
I had been serving under such a despicable man?!

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.810
Traitor!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.910
Shit!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:50.400
We aren't getting anywhere.
We have to think of a plan.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.720
Shoot!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.290
Seimei!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.630
Stupid!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:13.390
What are you doing?!

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.630
What do you mean?

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:18.200
We're at a disadvantage if we don't fight separately!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.360
If we stay gathered in one place...

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.730
Kaguya!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.310
I will trap Rudra within.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.100
Kaguya!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:05.180
Kaguya! Are you all right?

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:09.780
This is nothing. I am a Madou tool, after all.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:13.450
If longing is not greed...

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:18.660
Hurry!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.530
He sure is taking his time!

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.460
I cannot watch!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:27.800
Your name is Kaguya, the one who seals Rudra.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:30.770
The twelve lines carved into you are twelve parts of a spell

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.870
which cut the twelve ties of darkness

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:36.640
and seals away the powerful Horror, Rudra.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:43.350
The nature of man and the very depths of their own darkness.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:49.060
With this spell, Rudra will be unable to wield that power.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:51.020
Now, Kaguya.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:57.500
It is now the time to seal Rudra away within the Crimson Moon.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.000
Resistance is not frantic struggle.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.470
I have remembered! It is a spell!

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.910
What?!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:10.340
The words that come to me are parts of the spell to seal Rudra!

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:13.850
In total, there are twelve.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.040
Two more are left.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.040
Yasusuke!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.900
--Yasusuke!
--Yasusuke-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:43.260
Sorry for the wait, all of you.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:46.750
Yasusuke.

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:49.720
Looks like he made it.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:54.020
That barrier can't be broken without armor, after all.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:57.560
All that is left is the information he has for Kaguya.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:02.060
Then, she will truly regain all her power.

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:06.770
As expected of a self-proclaimed thief.

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:11.410
Though this time, we have cut it quite close.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:14.210
Rudra has left Seimei.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:17.140
I know. That's why I'm here.

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:22.210
Now I can wholeheartedly get revenge for my brother.

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:28.890
I would give you a hug if it wasn't a time like this.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:33.260
Those wisecracking words are definitely Seimei's.

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:35.330
Kaguya, take this.

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:38.790
Haruaki-<i>dono</i> asked the Watchdog Center for this.

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:59.950
With this, the lines are complete.

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.150
Rudra.

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:11.470
I now remember what I truly am.

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.470
A Madou tool of sealing.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:16.300
I will seal you away with this power!

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:18.940
Let's go!

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:20.000
--Yeah!
--Yes!

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:01.230
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:11.210
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.330 --> 00:23:18.370
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:24.360
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:30.710
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:35.850
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:42.480
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:47.690
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:50.990 --> 00:24:01.000
"Next Episode: ASSAULT MOON"

00:23:52.590 --> 00:23:54.490
Connecting feelings.

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:59.870
The eyes gaze intently toward the distant tomorrow.
